{
  "name": "@seamstack/create-seam-vendor",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Not a real package — the single source of truth for third-party package versions create-seam scaffolds into new projects. Resolved into layers/_layer.json (via scripts/build-templates.ts) and into engine/index.ts (via a JSON import) at create-seam's own build time. Never installed or imported by any running code; `pnpm install` here only exists to prove every pin actually resolves and to give Dependabot a real manifest+lockfile to open version-bump PRs against.",
